00:00:26.593 --> 00:00:28.929 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ça semble être complétement

00:00:27.494 --> 00:00:29.830 size:53% position:73% line:53%
plein. C'est des civières

00:00:28.362 --> 00:00:30.698 size:53% position:73% line:53%
un petit peu partout

00:00:29.263 --> 00:00:31.598 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dans les corridors.

00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:32.466 size:53% position:73% line:53%
es corridors, loin

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:33.333 size:53% position:73% line:53%
